/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb

# Rendered output never sits beside a source file. The root allowlist already
# hides `_book/`; this line covers the other direction, which is a stray page
# landing in `book/` itself.
#
# The sibling project committed 30 chapters that way once, as byte-identical
# duplicates of `_book/`. A full render deletes them, so every later render then
# produced 30 spurious deletions, which invited copying them back and kept the
# accident alive for two more sessions. Verify a render by reading `_book/`, and
# never copy anything out of it.
*.html
